{"code":"fil-PH","name":"Tagalog","native":"Tagalog","variant":"Filipino","badge":"TL","tts":"fil-PH","about":"Add po to the end of a line to be polite to strangers and anyone older. English words mix in freely.","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Hindi ko maintindihan.","say":"hin-DEE ko ma-in-tin-DEE-han","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Hindi ko alam.","say":"hin-DEE ko a-LAM","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Sandali lang po.","say":"san-da-LEE lang po","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Pakiulit po?","say":"pa-kee-OO-lit po","en":"Can you repeat that, please?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Dahan-dahan lang po.","say":"da-HAN da-HAN lang po","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Ano ang “…” sa Tagalog?","say":"a-NO ang … sa ta-GA-log","en":"What’s “…” in Tagalog?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Sige.","say":"SEE-geh","en":"Sure. / OK.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Tama.","say":"TA-ma","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Sa tingin ko, oo.","say":"sa TEE-ngin ko, OH-oh","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Talaga?","say":"ta-LA-ga","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Okay lang.","say":"o-KAY lang","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Ang galing!","say":"ang ga-LING","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Nasaan ang {x}?","say":"na-sa-AN ang {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Gusto ko {x:acc}.","say":"GOOS-to ko {x:acc}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"May {x} ba kayo?","say":"mai {x} ba ka-YO","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x} nga po.","say":"{x} nga po","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Kailangan kong {x}.","say":"kai-LA-ngan kong {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Puwede ba akong {x}?","say":"PWEH-deh ba a-KONG {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Titingnan ko.","say":"tee-ting-NAN ko","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"May meeting ako.","say":"mai MEE-ting a-KO","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Maanghang ba?","say":"ma-ang-HANG ba","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Walang sibuyas po.","say":"wa-LANG see-BOO-yas po","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Ano ang masarap dito?","say":"a-NO ang ma-SA-rap DEE-to","en":"What’s good here?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Hindi ako kumakain ng karne.","say":"hin-DEE a-KO ku-ma-KA-in nang KAR-neh","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Magkano?","say":"mag-KA-no","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Tumitingin lang po.","say":"tu-mee-TEE-ngin lang po","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Kukunin ko ito.","say":"ku-KU-nin ko EE-to","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Puwede bang magbayad gamit ang card?","say":"PWEH-deh bang mag-BA-yad GA-mit ang kard","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Malayo ba?","say":"ma-LA-yo ba","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Sa airport po.","say":"sa ER-port po","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"kaliwa · kanan · diretso","say":"ka-lee-WA · KA-nan · dee-RET-so","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Saklolo!","say":"sak-LO-lo","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Walang tisyu sa CR.","say":"wa-LANG TEE-syu sa see-AR","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Masama ang pakiramdam ko.","say":"ma-SA-ma ang pa-kee-ram-DAM ko","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Tumawag kayo ng ambulansya!","say":"tu-MA-wag ka-YO nang am-bu-LAN-sya","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Ikinagagalak kitang makilala.","say":"ee-kee-na-ga-GA-lak kee-TANG ma-kee-LA-la","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Taga-saan ka?","say":"ta-ga-sa-AN ka","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Ano ang trabaho mo?","say":"a-NO ang tra-BA-ho mo","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Ang sarap!","say":"ang sa-RAP","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Magandang araw.","say":"ma-gan-DANG A-raw","en":"Hello. (good day)","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Magandang umaga.","say":"ma-gan-DANG u-MA-ga","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Kumusta ka?","say":"ku-mus-TA ka","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Oo. · Hindi.","say":"OH-oh · hin-DEE","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Pakiusap.","say":"pa-kee-U-sap","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Salamat.","say":"sa-LA-mat","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Pasensya na.","say":"pa-SEN-sya na","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Paalam.","say":"pa-A-lam","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"isa · dalawa · tatlo","say":"ee-SA · da-la-WA · tat-LO","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"apat · lima · anim","say":"A-pat · lee-MA · A-nim","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"pito · walo · siyam","say":"pee-TO · wa-LO · SHAM","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"sampu · dalawampu · isang daan","say":"sam-POO · da-la-wam-POO · ee-SANG da-AN","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Pula ang mansanas.","say":"pu-LA ang man-SA-nas","en":"The apple is red.","note":"the description often comes first · ang marks the topic"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Kinakain ko ang mansanas.","say":"kee-na-KA-in ko ang man-SA-nas","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"verb first"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Kinain ko ang mansanas.","say":"kee-NA-in ko ang man-SA-nas","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"the verb changes inside: kinain = ate"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Gusto kong kainin ang mansanas.","say":"GOOS-to kong ka-EE-nin ang man-SA-nas","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"gusto + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Kumakain ka ba ng mansanas?","say":"ku-ma-KA-in ka ba nang man-SA-nas","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"ba makes a yes/no question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"CR","say":"see-AR","en":"the restroom (comfort room)","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"botika","say":"bo-TEE-ka","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"ospital","say":"os-pee-TAL","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"istasyon","say":"ees-tas-YON","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"airport","say":"ER-port","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hotel","say":"ho-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"tubig","say":"TU-big","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink","acc":"ng tubig","accSay":"nang TU-big"},{"id":"coffee","t":"kape","say":"KA-peh","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink","acc":"ng kape","accSay":"nang KA-peh"},{"id":"bill","t":"bill","say":"bil","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt","acc":"ang bill","accSay":"ang bil"},{"id":"menu","t":"menu","say":"MEH-nu","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order","acc":"ang menu","accSay":"ang MEH-nu"},{"id":"beer","t":"beer","say":"beer","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol","acc":"ng beer","accSay":"nang beer"},{"id":"this","t":"ito","say":"EE-to","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"supot","say":"SU-pot","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag","acc":"ng supot","accSay":"nang SU-pot"},{"id":"meeting","t":"meeting","say":"MEE-ting","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"file","say":"fail","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"screen","say":"skreen","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"mensahe","say":"men-SA-heh","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"bukas","say":"BU-kas","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"umalis","say":"u-ma-LIS","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"pumasok","say":"pu-ma-SOK","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"magbayad","say":"mag-BA-yad","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Allergy · pakibasa po","ask":"May ganitong sangkap po ba ang pagkaing ito?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Maraming salamat po!","note":"Vegetable dishes are often cooked with pork or shrimp paste (bagoong). Ask anyway.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Malala ang allergy ko sa mani. Hindi ako puwedeng kumain ng mani o mantika ng mani.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Malala ang allergy ko sa lamang-dagat na may shell (hipon, alimango, tahong).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Hindi ako puwedeng kumain ng gluten (trigo).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Hindi ako kumakain ng karne, manok, o isda.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Hindi ako kumakain ng baboy.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"CR · PALIKURAN","en":"Restroom (CR = comfort room)"},{"t":"LALAKI · BABAE","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"LABASAN · PASUKAN","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ITULAK · HILAHIN","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"EMERGENCY EXIT","en":"Emergency exit"}]}